% ===== OPEN DOORWAY MOTIF — threshold line, teal frame, door leaf swung
% open to the left (a quadrilateral), lamp light (concentric gold circles)
% inside the doorway, and a short path of light across the threshold.
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.85, transform shape]
  \draw[TruthTeal, line width=0.8pt] (-2.9,0) -- (2.9,0);
  \fill[LampGold, opacity=0.18] (-0.75,0) rectangle (0.75,2.2);
  \fill[LampGold, opacity=0.25] (-0.75,0) -- (0.75,0) -- (1.5,-0.45) -- (-1.5,-0.45) -- cycle;
  \fill[LampGold, opacity=0.35] (0,1.25) circle (0.32);
  \fill[LampGold] (0,1.25) circle (0.12);
  \draw[TruthTeal, line width=1.6pt] (-0.75,0) -- (-0.75,2.2) -- (0.75,2.2) -- (0.75,0);
  \draw[TruthTeal, line width=1.2pt, fill=ScriptureBg] (-0.75,0) -- (-0.75,2.2) -- (-1.55,2.45) -- (-1.55,-0.18) -- cycle;
  \fill[ScriptureGold] (-1.38,1.05) circle (0.05);
\end{tikzpicture}

\vspace{0.05cm}
{\fontsize{9}{11}\selectfont\color{TextGray} 敞開的門 \textperiodcentered\ The Open Door}

\vspace{0.15cm}
\textcolor{ScriptureGold}{\rule{2.8in}{0.8pt}}
\vspace{0.24cm}

{\fontsize{34}{40}\selectfont\bfseries\color{TruthTeal}\kaiti\selectfont 接}\\[0.10cm]
{\fontsize{16}{20}\selectfont\scshape\color{CommentaryBrown} Received}

\vspace{0.20cm}
{\fontsize{22}{26}\selectfont\bfseries\kaiti\selectfont 約翰三書研讀}\\[0.08cm]
{\fontsize{13}{16}\selectfont\itshape\color{TextGray} A Study of the Third Letter of John}

\vspace{0.24cm}
{\fontsize{15}{18}\selectfont\itshape\color{TruthTeal} ἀλήθεια}\quad
{\footnotesize\scshape\color{CommentaryBrown} “alētheia”}\quad
{\footnotesize\bfseries\color{ShutSlate} 真理 \textperiodcentered\ 接待 \textperiodcentered\ 見證}

\vfill

\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{white}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.3in}
\centering\vspace{0.15cm}
{\footnotesize\color{TruthTeal}\kaiti\selectfont
「所以我們應該接待這樣的人，叫我們與他們一同為真理做工。」}\\[0.10em]
{\scriptsize\itshape\color{TextGray}
“Therefore we ought to support such men, so that we may be fellow workers with the truth.”}\\[0.10em]
{\scriptsize\color{TruthTeal} 約翰三書 8 \textperiodcentered\ 3 John 8}
\vspace{0.15cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.3in}
\end{center}
\cleardoublepage

%% ============================================
%% FRONTISPIECE — "全書一句話" spread built on 3 John 8, the letter's
%% one "therefore … we ought", the same role Ruth 1:16, Job 42:5-6 and
%% Acts 1:8 play in the sister volumes.
%% ============================================
\thispagestyle{empty}
\begin{center}
\vspace*{0.3in}

\begin{tikzpicture}
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (-2.8,0) -- (-0.55,0);
  \fill[ScriptureGold] (0,0) circle (0.055);
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (0.55,0) -- (2.8,0);
\end{tikzpicture}

\vspace{0.22cm}
{\Large\bfseries\color{TruthTeal} 全書一句話 \textperiodcentered\ The Whole Book in One Verse}

\vspace{0.30cm}
\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{ScriptureBg}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\centering\vspace{0.2cm}
\normalsize\color{CommentaryBrown}
因他們是為主的名出外，對於外邦人一無所取。\\
所以\textbf{\color{LampGold!80!black}我們應該接待這樣的人}，\\
叫我們與他們\textbf{\color{LampGold!80!black}一同為真理做工}。\\[0.5em]
\footnotesize\itshape
For they went out for the sake of the Name, accepting nothing from the Gentiles.\\
Therefore \textbf{we ought to support such men},\\
so that we may be \textbf{fellow workers with the truth}.\\[0.4em]
\small\color{TruthTeal} 約翰三書 7-8 \textperiodcentered\ 3 John 7-8
\vspace{0.2cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.35cm}
{\small\color{TextGray} 十五節 \textperiodcentered\ 五卷 \textperiodcentered\ 三個人，三扇門\\
\textit{Fifteen verses \textperiodcentered\ five parts \textperiodcentered\ three men, three doors}}

\vspace{0.30cm}
{\small
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.3}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{3.3cm}p{1.6cm}p{7.2cm}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{卷別} & \textbf{經文} & \textbf{真理的動作} \\
\midrule
卷一 \textperiodcentered\ 在真理中 & 1-4節 & 真理在先——愛是在真理中的愛，行走是在真理中的行走 \\
卷二 \textperiodcentered\ 為那名出外 & 5-8節 & 真理被差出去——靠肢體的接待往前走，接待的人成了同工 \\
卷三 \textperiodcentered\ 關上的門 & 9-10節 & 真理被拒絕——好為首的丟特腓，在教會裏把門關上 \\
卷四 \textperiodcentered\ 真理作見證 & 11-12節 & 真理親自作見證——判斷的最後一層屬於真理本身 \\
卷五 \textperiodcentered\ 面對面 & 13-15節 & 終點是面對面——紙墨讓位給同在，名單讓位給名字 \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
}

\vspace{0.4cm}
\textcolor{ScriptureGold}{\rule{2.5in}{0.7pt}}
\vspace{0.3cm}

{\bfseries\color{TruthTeal} 讀經之鑰 \textperiodcentered\ How to Read This Book}

\vspace{0.18cm}
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
不是來讀一張兩千年前的私人便條，是來看約翰福音 1:11-12 在一間家庭教會裏重演：
真理為那名出外，有人開門，有人關門。\\
若你讀完十五節卻只記得「要好客」——請從頭再讀，\\
這次留意：每一扇門外站的，都是為「那名」而來的人。\\[0.5em]
\textit{\footnotesize
You are not reading a private note from two thousand years ago — you are
watching John 1:11-12 replayed in one house church: the truth goes out for
the Name, one man opens his door, another shuts his.\\
If after fifteen verses you remember only "be hospitable," read it again.\\
This time notice: whoever stands outside each door has come for the sake of
the Name.}
\end{minipage}

\vspace{0.3in}
\end{center}
\cleardoublepage

